      "questionEn": "What historical period does Edad Moderna normally name?",
      "answerEn": "Edad Moderna is the conventional Spanish name for the Early Modern period.",
      "noteEn": "In common Spanish historical periodization, the Edad Moderna follows the Edad Media and precedes the Edad Contemporánea. Exact boundary dates vary, but the name is a conventional period label rather than simply any age that feels modern.",
